    "description": "Typical materials-quantity reference data for residential single-family construction, keyed by stage_id (matching knowledge/dependency_graph.json's stage ids exactly). Consumed by: app/services/cost_estimation_service.py (Sprint 17).",
    "scope": "Residential single-family construction",
    "estimate_disclaimer": "Every quantity below is a TYPICAL/APPROXIMATE reference figure drawn from standard residential construction estimating ratios, not a historical-data-driven measurement from any project in this system. Combined with knowledge/construction_ontology.json's own cost_range_per_unit_usd ranges, these produce a reference cost RANGE for a project of a given square footage -- never a quote, never a bid, and never a claim of learning from past projects. Labor hours are deliberately not included here: no defensible reference source for labor rates exists in this dataset (see docs/DECISIONS.md ADR-065)."
  },
